# Runtime reports produced by scripts/go-no-go.ts. Each launch attempt
# generates a fresh timestamped file; they are evidence artifacts for the
# launch ticket, not code, so they should not be checked into version
# control.
go-no-go-*.md
# Task #231 — per-deploy strict-gate verdict files written by
# `scripts/pre-launch-safety.ts --json-verdict <path>` via
# `scripts/predeploy-build.sh` Stage 1. Each invocation produces a fresh
# timestamped file; the trend signal lives in `docs/PRE_LAUNCH_CHECKLIST.md`
# (the recorder appends a one-line entry per file) and in
# `operator_alerts` rows of source `predeploy-strict-gate`. The raw JSON
# files themselves are runtime artefacts of the deploy build environment,
# not code, so they should not be checked into version control.
strict-gate-*.json
